reBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2320980,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1847286114039777","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"update","title":"Loftia Demo - Patch notes #3","summary":"Hi Loftians, there are just 2 days left of the Next Fest Demo being live, and we're here with one more set of fixes in our demo patch #3 that went live earlier today!Also, a quick reminder to check out the Early Access info page on our website to see what's still to come, when we launch on November 3rd!Patch notesHere are the fixes and changes we applied in a patch earlier today:🛠️ BugfixesAdditional fix for getting stuck while using Adventure antennas.Fixed blocked exits in some of the lake bio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039777","verified_at":"2026-10-24T15:01:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1847286114035141","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"update","title":"Loftia Demo - Patch notes #2","summary":"Hi Loftians!Steam Next Fest is in full swing and we're so excited to see so many of your try Loftia! There's been so many new players who have joined our community over the past few days, and it's amazing to see everyone get together and make the most out of the demo!The demo is only a very small part of the content, narrative and gameplay systems that Loftia will have at Early Access in less than 2 weeks. There’s so much more of Loftia to be discovered, and we can’t wait to experience it with y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:15:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035141","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:24:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1847286114028305","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"update","title":"Loftia Demo - Patch notes #1","summary":"Hi Loftians!It’s been such an exciting start to Steam Next Fest for Loftia and we’re incredibly thankful for everyone’s support. To be one of the top demos in the Next Fest is truly incredible, and we can’t express how grateful we are!The demo is only a small part of the content, narrative and gameplay systems that Loftia will have at Early Access in less than 2 weeks. There’s so much more of Loftia to be discovered, and we can’t wait to experience it with you. Head on over to the Early Access i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:10:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028305","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:48:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1846651706692404","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Loftia’s Free Demo is available right now to play!","summary":"Hi everyone!Loftia’s free demo is now live for anyone to start their journey into Loftia City!! This demo is a preview of what’s to come when we launch into Early Access on November 3rd. The demo is now available to download directly from our Steam page, for the duration of the October Steam Next Fest.Progress you make in this demo will carry over into Early Access! All completed quests, collected items, and character progression will remain with you when Early Access begins a week after the Nex","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:19:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692404","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1846018067929550","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"🎊 Loftia is coming to the October Steam Next Fest with a demo!","summary":"Hi everyone!Loftia will be participating in Steam Next Fest on October 19th, with a limited-time demo that everyone can download and play!!We know how excited everyone is to step into Loftia, and now we’re opening our sky islands a little earlier to give you a small preview of what’s to come when we launch into Early Access on November 3rd!🌱 Demo detailsThe demo will go live just before the Next Fest begins, on October 19th at 1pm EDT, and will remain playable for 1 week until the Next Fest ends","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:00:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929550","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1844115010499394","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"Loftia Release Date Announcement! 🎉","summary":"Hi everyone! It’s official: Loftia is coming to Early Access on November 3, 2026, on PC and Mac!! 🎉🎉🎉 This is the moment we’ve been working towards since we first started building Loftia in 2022. Back then, we were just a few people with a big idea: to create an online world where players could find their new home, spend time with friends, and build a brighter future, together. Since then, that idea has grown into something bigger than we ever imagined. On November 3, we’ll finally be opening up","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T16:54:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499394","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1844115010487958","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"Loftia Pre-Registration is Now Open! 🌱 🎉","summary":"Pre-registrations for Loftia are now open on our website! 🎉Hi everyone! Our journey toward Early Access is entering an exciting new chapter: pre-registration for Loftia is officially open!Head over to our website to pre-register for Loftia and get your account set up for Early Access! When Early Access launches, you’ll be able to link this account in-game, making it easy to manage your account and access the rewards you’ve collected along the way. Claim Special Pre-Registration Rewards 🎁Everyone","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T02:45:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487958","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1834602721194478","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"Loftia is coming to Early Access in Fall 2026! 🥳","summary":"Hi Loftians, today we're super excited to announce that Loftia is coming to Early Access in the Fall of this year! 🥳🥳🥳 We've just revealed this news to the world as part of the Wholesome Direct showcase, alongside our brand new Release Window Gameplay Trailer! This trailer features footage filmed during our recent Beta playtests, including moments captured by the Loftia community. A huge thank you to everyone who joined our trailer filming sessions and being a part of this milestone with us.As f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T18:35:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194478","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1833968530899460","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"Loftia won Most Anticipated Game at the Cozy Game Awards! 🎉","summary":"Hi everyone! It's been almost a month since our closed Beta playtests last month, and we have some exciting updates to share today! 🏆 Loftia won Most Anticipated Game at the Cozy Game Awards! Last week Loftia won Most Anticipated Game at the Cozy Game Awards! We were so honored to have been nominated alongside so many great games coming this year, and being able to take home the prize is incredible!! This wouldn't have been possible without this amazing community and your support over the past c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T05:35:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530899460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1830797770230080","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Beta in 12 hours! Updates and letters from the team 💛","summary":"Hi everyone!! Loftia's Closed Beta starts in just 12 hours! We've released our Official Beta Trailer - take a tour with Pebble through all three districts of Loftia and get a glimpse of what's coming in Beta! This includes our new district called the Gridfall - a rustic city with a punk-inspired, industrial aesthetic. 🎉 A big thank you to everyone who entered our Beta key giveaway on our last post! We received over 1,000 entries which is so incredible, we hope to host more giveaways in the futur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-22T08:53:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770230080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1828894815562560","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"Loftia Beta Key Giveaway! 🔑🎉","summary":"Hi everyone! With Loftia’s closed Beta playtests launching on April 22nd, we’re giving away some Beta keys here on Steam! Thank you so much for all the excitement and support for our upcoming Beta playtests, our team has been working really hard on getting the game ready, and we're really looking forward to the big day! To enter our Steam giveaway, just like this post and leave a comment below telling us what you’re most excited for in Loftia! Is it decorating your sky island? Going on group adv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-04T16:19:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815562560","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2320980-1827626365769570","game_id":"steam-2320980","kind":"announcement","title":"Loftia Closed Beta - Launching April 22nd!","summary":"Hi everyone! We’re excited to share that Loftia’s Beta playtest will be launching on Apr 22nd, 2026 at 2pm (PDT), fittingly on Earth Day! 🌍 It feels incredibly surreal to be reaching this milestone, and our team has been working super hard to deliver the best Beta possible. We can’t wait for everyone to experience the world that we’ve been dedicating these last few years to building. To celebrate, we’ve prepared a Beta teaser video below to showcase a first look at our new district, the Gridfall","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-26T03:47:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365769570","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2320980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"20